  "texts": [
    {
      "text": "Reconnect with your body. Restore your energy. Come home to yourself.\n\nSera Liora Wilde is a qualified Remedial Massage Therapist, Yoga Teacher and Reiki Master, and the founder of Sera Liora Wilde — The Wellness Collective in Birkdale.\n\nHer work brings together therapeutic bodywork, nervous-system-focused relaxation, Reiki, intuitive movement and holistic wellness to create personalised experiences for the whole person — body, mind and spirit.\n\nHaving personally navigated and recovered from Stage 4 cancer through natural and holistic approaches, Sera brings a deeply embodied perspective to her work and a strong belief in supporting the body's innate intelligence and capacity for healing.\n\nHer approach is grounded in compassion, presence and respect for each person's individual journey. Every treatment is adapted to what your body needs on the day — whether that means targeted remedial work, deep relaxation, flowing Lomi Lomi, energetic support or simply creating space to slow down and reconnect with yourself.\n\n🤲 BODYWORK & MASSAGE\n\nRemedial Massage\nTargeted therapeutic massage tailored to your individual needs, whether you're working with muscular tension, niggling pain, restricted movement or simply need some focused bodywork.\n30 minutes — $60\n45 minutes -- $90\n60 minutes — $120\n90 minutes — $180\n($2/min)\n\nWild Signature Blend\nA bespoke fusion of modalities from Sera's holistic toolkit, intuitively tailored to you and your body's needs.\n105 minutes — $210\n\nReset Massage\nA full-body sweep designed to encourage nervous-system relaxation without spending too long anywhere. A beautiful option when your body needs attention but your nervous system needs to soften.\n45 minutes — $90\n\nRelaxation Massage\nSlow, soothing bodywork designed to encourage deep relaxation and help you switch off from the outside world.\n60 minutes — $120\n\nLomi Lomi Hawaiian-Style Massage\nA flowing, rhythmic Hawaiian-style massage using long, continuous strokes and luxurious coconut oil to create a deeply immersive relaxation experience.\n90 minutes — $190\nAdditional $10 to cover oil.\n\nFeather Bliss Massage\nAn ultra-light, sensory massage using gentle, feather-light touch for a deeply relaxing and nurturing experience.\n60 minutes — $120\n\nAdd Hot Stones\nAdd the warmth and grounding sensation of hot stones to any massage.\n+$20 — adds 10 minutes\n\nAdd Reiki\nEnhance any massage with a short Reiki treatment.\n+$20 — adds 10 minutes\n\n✨ REIKI & ENERGY WORK\n\nReiki \nGentle energetic healing designed to create space for relaxation, stillness and reconnection.\n40 mins - $80\n\nReiki & Crystal Chakra Balancing\nA personalised combination of Reiki and crystal chakra work designed to support relaxation, energetic balance and a deeper sense of connection.\n60 minutes — $120\n\nAromatic Reiki Escape\nA deeply relaxing combination of Reiki and aromatherapy, creating a sensory experience designed to encourage relaxation and rejuvenation.\n90 minutes — $190\nAdditional $10 to cover essential oils.\n\nSeriniScalp Massage\nA deeply relaxing scalp treatment designed to release tension and create a sense of calm and rejuvenation.\n60 minutes — $130\nAdditional $10 to cover oil.\n\n🌿 SPECIALISED WELLNESS EXPERIENCES\n\nMagnesium Bath\nA relaxing magnesium bath experience designed to encourage relaxation while supporting muscle comfort and skin nourishment.\n20 minutes — $40\n\nYoni Steaming\nSera is currently studying with Yoni Steam Australia and working alongside Angie to facilitate yoni steaming experiences.\nYoni steaming is offered as a feminine wellness and ritual experience, providing intentional time to slow down, reconnect with the body and explore embodied self-care.\n30 minutes — $80\nOrganic herb blend included.\n\nMobile, Corporate Massage & Events\nBring massage and wellness directly to your workplace, event or gathering.\n$240 — 2-hour minimum booking\nContact Sera for additional hours or day-rate enquiries.\n\n🧘 YOGA\n\nYoga 1:1\nPersonalised one-on-one yoga guidance designed to support your individual practice, whether you're a beginner or simply need accountability and guidance to get moving again.\n60 minutes — $60\nPrivate classes can accommodate up to 3 people. Contact Sera for details\n\n🔥 REIKI TRAINING\n\nFirst Degree Reiki — 2-Day Training\nBegin your Reiki journey with First Degree Reiki training, held across two mornings for accessible, bite-sized learning.\nExplore Reiki practices and techniques that you can begin incorporating into your own life and practice.\n$150 per day\n10am–2pm. Both days are booked together.\n\n🌸 MOTHER & FEMININE WELLNESS\n\nSera's work also has a particular interest in women's wellbeing, embodied movement and feminine wellness.\nThrough bodywork, Reiki, yoga and emerging yoni steaming facilitation, she creates spaces where women can slow down, reconnect with their bodies and receive nurturing, intentional care.\nYoni steaming experiences are currently facilitated alongside Angie of Yoni Steam Australia while Sera completes her studies.\n\n🌿 HOLISTIC SUPPORT\n\nConsultancy\nHave an idea you'd like to get off the ground but need someone to help you research, organise and make sense of the information? Sera has a way to get you lit up about your vision and completing actionable steps towards your goals. \n20 minutes — $40\n\nHome Organisation\nFor those who feel overwhelmed by their space and want practical support creating a more organised, functional environment.\n$120 per hour\n2-hour minimum booking.\n\n🌺 A WHOLE-BODY APPROACH\n\nSera's work isn't about forcing your body into a particular treatment protocol.\n\nIt's about listening.\n\nSome days you might need focused remedial work. Other days your body might be asking for slow, flowing massage, Reiki, gentle movement or simply permission to stop and breathe.\n\nYour treatment can be tailored accordingly.\n\nCome exactly as you are.\n\n🌙 BEYOND THE TREATMENT ROOM\n\nSera also runs Reiki certification trainings and is the founder of DreamWeaver CommUnity Dance — a seasonal conscious dance gathering bringing children and adults together through music, movement, play, freedom and community.\n\n✨ JOIN THE DREAMWEAVER COMMUNITY\nhttps://www.facebook.com/share/g/1AYcoFckjU/\n\n🌿 QUALIFICATIONS & TRAINING\n\n• Diploma of Remedial Massage — Evolve College\n• Registered Remedial Massage Therapist\n• ATMS Member\n• Reiki Master\n• Yoga Teacher\n• Lomi Lomi Massage - Nalu Massage\n• Hot Stone Massage - Nalu Massage\n• 200hr Hatha Yoga Teacher Training — Rishikesh, India\n• 200hr Yin & Ashtanga Yoga Teacher Training — Bali\n• Currently studying with Yoni Steam Australia",
